-lesPJm-iflOWrr-css">50<!-- --> Cart Abandonment Rate Statistics<!-- --> <!-- -->2026</h1><p id="70-22-average-documented-online-shopping-cart-abandonment-rate" class="c-lesPJm c-PJLV c-lesPJm-eGlBHF-textVariant-h4 c-lesPJm-ibBcGlh-css">70.22<!-- -->% – average documented online shopping cart abandonment rate</p></div><p class="c-lesPJm c-PJLV">Based on the data we collected, we’ve calculated the average cart abandonment rate of <!-- -->70.22<!-- -->%. This value is an average calculated based on <!-- -->50<!-- --> different studies containing statistics on ecommerce shopping cart abandonment.</p><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-ieNawsX-css"><div class="c-lesPJm c-lesPJm-ihdFcmA-css"><div class="c-lesPJm c-jARgyX c-lesPJm-ieGTiar-css"><button class="react-share__ShareButton" style="background-color:transparent;border:none;padding:0;font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" role="img" aria-label="social-twitter" class="overflow-visible border-none fill-none"><title>social-twitter</title><use href="/_next/static/media/sprite.15y~yjhoi.1z2.svg?dpl=dpl_9EnadbREzGbdzNB4isWhqb59AThJ#icon-social-twitter"></use></svg></button></div><div class="c-lesPJm c-jARgyX c-lesPJm-iiRcDKD-css"><button class="react-share__ShareButton" style="background-color:transparent;border:none;padding:0;font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" role="img" aria-label="social-facebook" class="overflow-visible border-none fill-none"><title>social-facebook</title><use href="/_next/static/media/sprite.15y~yjhoi.1z2.svg?dpl=dpl_9EnadbREzGbdzNB4isWhqb59AThJ#icon-social-facebook"></use></svg></button></div><div class="c-lesPJm c-jARgyX c-lesPJm-idCTBOg-css"><button class="react-share__ShareButton" style="background-color:transparent;border:none;padding:0;font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" role="img" aria-label="social-linkedin" class="overflow-visible borde